Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 05:19:37 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Expose aux send pan azimuth (Shift+drag send).
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

InternalSend pannable pan_azimuth; P badge + knob on send track.
--smoke-send-pan: L→R→C on Audio1→Aux (Dummy exit 0).
